{"k":"p","w":19,"r":[{"t":"The Pact of Deceit is a psychological elimination game where truth can save you, lies can crown you, and both can destroy you.\u000a The qualifying round is played in "},{"t":"Pods","b":1},{"t":" — small groups competing to produce "},{"t":"one winner","b":1},{"t":" who advances to the next stage.\u000a Any number of players can join; pods run endlessly."}]},
{"k":"gap","w":72},
{"k":"p","w":72,"r":[{"t":"You bid an amount between 10-80 coins, claim an amount which can be false or true in your group and also send to me. The false claims gets exposed at the end of the round and the coins are taken from them. Also the one who bids the least amount loses and gets their coins taken as well. And 20 coins get taken if you don't bid in the round."}]},
{"k":"p","w":142,"r":[{"t":"After bidding every single round, I'm giving y'all 8 hours of time to have discussions with the others. If you can expose who/which group of people claimed a false amount, you win the round and the house gives you 20 coins each for doing so. But if you can't manage to find the false claimers, 10 coins will be deducted from your balance."}]},
{"k":"p","w":205,"r":[{"t":"One round-16 hours of bidding+8hours of discussion."}]},
